{"id":"617245","name":"简版煮馍","author":"和月香","authorId":"12842754","desc":"","cover":"images/617245/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"坨坨馍","amount":"1个"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"1把"},{"name":"肉汤","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"豆芽","amount":"50克"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"2朵"},{"name":"黄花","amount":"1把"},{"name":"鱼豆腐","amount":"1片"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"1棵"},{"name":"糖蒜","amount":"1头"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"半勺"},{"name":"轻盐酱油","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"半勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"黄花、木耳泡发，洗净切段。坨坨馍掰块，鱼豆腐切片。","img":"images/617245/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"提前熬好的肉汤化冻。","img":"images/617245/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"粉丝冲洗一下","img":"images/617245/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"豆芽洗净。","img":"images/617245/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"香菜切段。","img":"images/617245/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"肉汤放入锅中，添水，加盐、料酒、酱油，煮沸腾，放入黄花、木耳，煮5分钟。","img":"images/617245/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入鱼豆腐、馍块，煮3分钟。","img":"images/617245/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放豆芽、粉丝，豆芽煮熟，粉丝煮软。","img":"images/617245/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加胡椒粉、鸡精，搅匀，撒香菜，开吃。","img":"images/617245/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"冬天吃一大碗，味美还暖和。","img":"images/617245/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"就着糖蒜吃，聊咋咧。","img":"images/617245/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}